part mot_1
  tally 1
  law
  note "MOT-1 · Compulsory insurance on a sale: the seller's policy ends on the day of the sale (.2); the insurer refunds the premium from the day after to the policy's own end, as the policy's terms compute it (.3)."

source mot_1 "Motor Vehicles Act, MOT-1 Compulsory insurance on a sale (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version mot1_v1
  cite mot_1
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-09-01
  note "MOT-1 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-09-01; governs sales from 2018-01-01."
